# um-texts 1
=== QUESTITEM Ancientsword
Rusty sword
The Craftsman cannot infuse this sword with a spell. And without a spell, alas...you have just a rusty piece of iron!

=== QUESTITEM ArmoryKey
Arsenal key
The key to the arsenal! You must return it to Governor Valrasian.

=== QUESTITEM BridgeBoard00
A plank to repair the bridge
The broken bridge from one island to the other can be repaired by means of this plank.

=== QUESTITEM CodeNote
Document from the city
An important document which you must give to Brother Khatul.

=== QUESTITEM DragonAmuletS
Dragon amulet
Using this amulet, Lizards can make allies of Dragons.

=== QUESTITEM HeadGoblinS
Goblin totem
The head of the First Goblin. If you put it on the Orcs' Council Mountain, the Orcs will quarrel with the Goblins.

=== QUESTITEM HeadNecro
Zombie Magician's head
You must bring the Zombie Magician's head to the disgraced Necromancer Kholai.

=== QUESTITEM PyrKey
Obelisk key
This key controls the Magic Obelisk which in turn is connected to the pyramid.

=== QUESTITEM goldNuggetS
Golden nugget
A golden nugget.

